abstract: "SM-ECO-10060 defines 49 sovereign jurisdiction members plus the SM apex. Each jurisdiction is an authority for its own rule-set namespace; every Allooloo issuer record states the jurisdiction it was read under and the duty that applies there. It pairs with ACM-68000 (the signal vocabulary) and the per-market Electronic Compliance Object pages."
keywords:
  - capital markets
  - issuer record
  - jurisdiction
  - ACM-68000
  - open standard
